<title>POLAND: Polish Korona fund NAV jumps 59.8 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Polish Korona fund NAV jumps 59.8 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The net asset value per unit of Poland's Korona Trust Fund Co.'s balanced fund rose 59.8 percent last year to 81.55 zlotys in 1996, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the fund's assets rose to 52.2 million zlotys at the end of 1996, up from 16.3 million at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>It did not give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
